{"text":"That same night, sixty-six million years later, your mom can't sleep. She hasn't slept a whole night since you disappeared. She lies in the dark, looking at the photo on her nightstand, and goes over it again. The locked door. The empty bed. The window, shut. At some point after three, she finally falls asleep. And she dreams. She's standing in a forest that's grey and burnt, under a sky the colour of wet ash.","mood":"sad","settings":{"stability":0.4,"style":0.7,"speed":1.02},"alignment":{"characters":["T","h","a","t"," ","s","a","m","e"," ","n","i","g","h","t",","," ","s","i","x","t","y","-","s","i","x"," ","m","i","l","l","i","o","n"," ","y","e","a","r","s"," ","l","a","t","e","r",","," ","y","o","u","r"," ","m","o","m"," ","c","a","n","'","t"," ","s","l","e","e","p","."," ","S","h","e"," ","h","a","s","n","'","t"," ","s","l","e","p","t"," ","a"," ","w","h","o","l","e"," ","n","i","g","h","t"," ","s","i","n","c","e"," ","y","o","u"," ","d","i","s","a","p","p","e","a","r","e","d","."," ","S","h","e"," ","l","i","e","s"," ","i","n"," ","t","h","e"," ","d","a","r","k",","," ","l","o","o","k","i","n","g"," ","a","t"," ","t","h","e"," ","p","h","o","t","o"," ","o","n"," ","h","e","r"," ","n","i","g","h","t","s","t","a","n","d",","," ","a","n","d"," ","g","o","e","s"," ","o","v","e","r"," ","i","t"," ","a","g","a","i","n","."," ","T","h","e"," ","l","o","c","k","e","d"," ","d","o","o","r","."," ","T","h","e"," ","e","m","p","t","y"," ","b","e","d","."," ","T","h","e"," ","w","i","n","d","o","w",","," ","s","h","u","t","."," ","A","t"," ","s","o","m","e"," ","p","o","i","n","t"," ","a","f","t","e","r"," ","t","h","r","e","e",","," ","s","h","e"," ","f","i","n","a","l","l","y"," ","f","a","l","l","s"," ","a","s","l","e","e","p","."," ","A","n","d"," ","s","h","e"," ","d","r","e","a","m","s","."," ","S","h","e","'","s"," ","s","t","a","n","d","i","n","g"," ","i","n"," ","a"," ","f","o","r","e","s","t"," ","t","h","a","t","'","s"," ","g","r","e","y"," ","a","n","d